7. The U S based Buyers have hold orders due to increased tariff by U S Government, but none of the orders has been cancelled by them. The negotations with U S based Buyers is going on.  &lt;BR&gt; 
8. Corresponding figures in previous year / period have been regrouped wherever considered necessary. &lt;BR&gt; 
9. There are no subsidiary/associate/joint venture company(ies) and hence only Standalone financials are provided. &lt;BR&gt; 
